{"seq":3,"slug":"preprocessing-features","title":"预处理与特征工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/foundations/preprocessing-features","wordCount":1504,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"预处理与特征工程\">预处理与特征工程</h1><p>有一个广为流传却屡试不爽的经验：在时间序列项目里，把数据准备做对带来的提升，往往超过把模型从 LSTM 换成 Transformer。原因很简单——深度网络是「分布敏感型」学习者，输入尺度、缺失模式、窗口构造的任何瑕疵都会被放大成预测误差。这一篇专讲那些不性感却致命的环节：它们共同决定了后续所有模型表现的天花板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>预处理与特征工程的目标，是把一条原始序列转换成神经网络「吃得下、学得动」的张量，同时不引入任何来自未来的信息。整个流程是一条有严格先后顺序的流水线，顺序错了就会泄漏。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始序列] --&gt; B[缺失值处理&lt;br/&gt;插补 or 掩码]&#10;    B --&gt; C[异常值处理&lt;br/&gt;截断 or 标记]&#10;    C --&gt; D[归一化 / 标准化&lt;br/&gt;只用训练集统计量]&#10;    D --&gt; E[滑动窗口切样本&lt;br/&gt;L 步输入 H 步目标]&#10;    E --&gt; F[特征拼接]&#10;    F --&gt; G[日历特征&lt;br/&gt;星期/月/节假日]&#10;    F --&gt; H[滞后与滚动特征&lt;br/&gt;lag/rolling mean]&#10;    F --&gt; I[协变量对齐]&#10;    G --&gt; J[模型输入张量]&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始序列] --&gt; B[缺失值处理&lt;br/&gt;插补 or 掩码]\n    B --&gt; C[异常值处理&lt;br/&gt;截断 or 标记]\n    C --&gt; D[归一化 / 标准化&lt;br/&gt;只用训练集统计量]\n    D --&gt; E[滑动窗口切样本&lt;br/&gt;L 步输入 H 步目标]\n    E --&gt; F[特征拼接]\n    F --&gt; G[日历特征&lt;br/&gt;星期/月/节假日]\n    F --&gt; H[滞后与滚动特征&lt;br/&gt;lag/rolling mean]\n    F --&gt; I[协变量对齐]\n    G --&gt; J[模型输入张量]\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J</pre><p>下表归纳常见的特征类型及其防泄漏要点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征类型</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>防泄漏要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日历特征</td>\n<td>星期、月份、是否节假日</td>\n<td>未来已知，可安全使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滞后特征</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{t-1}, y_{t-7}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>只能用预测时刻已知的滞后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚动统计</td>\n<td>7 日均值、标准差</td>\n<td>窗口不能跨越预测时点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>傅里叶项</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin/\\cos</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span></span></span></span></span> 周期编码</td>\n<td>确定性，安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外生协变量</td>\n<td>天气、价格</td>\n<td>区分历史可得与未来已知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"缺失值与异常值\">缺失值与异常值</h2><p>真实序列几乎从不完整——传感器掉线、节假日停业、记录漏填。处理缺失值有两条路线。一是插补：前向填充（适合台阶式数据）、线性插值（适合平滑变化）、或基于季节的插补（用同一相位的历史均值）。二是掩码：保留缺失位置，额外加一个「是否缺失」的二值通道，让模型自己学习缺失的含义——现代深度模型与许多 <a href=\"../modern/foundation-models-ts\">时序基础模型</a> 都内置了对缺失的处理。关键纪律是：插补所用的统计量必须只来自训练集，绝不能用整段序列（含测试集）的均值去填训练样本，否则就是 <a href=\"ts-problem-framing\">时间序列问题建模</a> 里反复强调的数据泄漏。</p>\n<p>异常值的处理同样需要克制。机械地删除或截断离群点，可能恰好抹掉了你真正想预测的尖峰（如黑五销量）。常见做法是温和截断（winsorize）到分位数边界，或保留原值但加标记。注意：异常检测本身是一个独立的大主题，其方法论见 <a href=\"../applications/anomaly-detection\">异常检测</a>，本篇只关注「为预测而做的清洗」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归一化与尺度处理\">归一化与尺度处理</h2><p>深度网络对输入尺度极其敏感，未归一化的输入会让梯度震荡、收敛缓慢。三种常见方式各有适用场景。标准化（z-score）减均值除标准差，适合近似高斯的序列：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>σ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{y}_t = \\frac{y_t - \\mu}{\\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最小-最大归一化把值压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，适合有明确上下界的量。当多条序列量纲差异巨大时（如有的店日销几件、有的几千件），更稳妥的是按序列各自的统计量做实例归一化。一个在长程预测中被反复验证有效的技巧是 RevIN（可逆实例归一化）：在输入端按每个实例减均值除标准差，在输出端再逆变换回去，专门对抗训练集与测试集之间的分布漂移，是 <a href=\"../modern/multivariate-long-horizon\">多变量与长程预测</a> 里许多强基线的标配组件。同样地，归一化的统计量必须只从训练集估计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滑动窗口与样本构造\">滑动窗口与样本构造</h2><p>把一条长序列变成一批 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>输入</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>目标</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\text{输入}, \\text{目标})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输入</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 监督样本，靠的是滑动窗口。给定回看长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 与预测视野 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>，窗口从序列头部滑到尾部，每个位置切出一对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(y_{t-L+1:t}, y_{t+1:t+H})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这里有两个常被忽视的细节。其一是步长（stride）：步长为 1 样本最多但相邻样本高度重叠，步长大则样本少而独立，需在数据量与冗余间权衡。其二是窗口边界绝不能越过 train/val/test 的时间分界，否则一个测试样本的输入窗口里就混进了训练期的数据，污染评估。回看长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的选择直接关系到能否覆盖完整季节周期，这一点在 <a href=\"../modern/multivariate-long-horizon\">多变量与长程预测</a> 中还会作为「长回看窗口」的核心议题再次出现。</p>\n<p>把上面的纪律落成代码，一个正确的样本构造大致如下——统计量只在训练段估计，窗口按步长切分，训练与测试之间还留出 gap：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def make_windows(series, lookback, horizon, stride=1, gap=0):&#10;    xs, ys = [], []&#10;    end = len(series) - lookback - gap - horizon&#10;    for t in range(0, end + 1, stride):&#10;        xs.append(series[t : t + lookback])&#10;        ys.append(series[t + lookback + gap : t + lookback + gap + horizon])&#10;    return xs, ys&#10;&#10;# 统计量只从训练段估计，再原样应用到验证与测试段&#10;mu, sigma = train.mean(), train.std()&#10;train = (train - mu) / sigma&#10;val = (val - mu) / sigma        # 绝不用验证段自身的统计量&#10;test = (test - mu) / sigma      # 绝不用测试段自身的统计量\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make_windows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(series, lookback, horizon, stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    xs, ys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [], []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(series) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lookback </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> horizon</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, stride):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        xs.append(series[t : t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lookback])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ys.append(series[t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lookback </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap : t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lookback </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> horizon])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xs, ys</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 统计量只从训练段估计，再原样应用到验证与测试段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mu, sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train.mean(), train.std()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">train </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (train </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 绝不用验证段自身的统计量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">test </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (test </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 绝不用测试段自身的统计量</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这两个细节最容易出错：<code>mu/sigma</code> 必须固定自训练段，其余各段沿用同一组值，否则就重现了「用全局统计量归一化」这一陷阱；切分训练/验证/测试之前，任何窗口都不应跨越其时间分界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间特征工程\">时间特征工程</h2><p>除了序列自身的值，时间本身携带大量信息。日历特征把时间戳拆成星期几、月份、是否节假日、是否月末等，它们都是未来已知的，可以安全地作为协变量喂给模型。周期性特征用傅里叶编码更优雅——直接把「星期」当作 0–6 的整数会让模型误以为周日（6）和周一（0）相距很远，而用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin(2\\pi k/7)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">/7</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos(2\\pi k/7)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">/7</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把周期映射到圆上，就保持了首尾相连的连续性。滞后特征与滚动统计（如 7 日均值、7 日标准差）能显式地把历史模式喂给那些不擅长长程记忆的模型；它们对树模型尤其关键，对深度模型则是锦上添花。所有这些特征的共同红线仍是：构造时不能引用预测时点之后的任何数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据准备的质量是后续所有模型表现的天花板，提升常超过换架构。</li>\n<li>缺失值用插补或掩码处理，异常值温和截断，统计量只从训练集估计。</li>\n<li>归一化对深度网络是必需；RevIN 等实例归一化专门对抗分布漂移。</li>\n<li>滑动窗口构造样本时，窗口绝不能越过 train/val/test 时间分界。</li>\n<li>日历特征、傅里叶周期编码、滞后与滚动统计是常用且安全（若不泄漏）的特征。</li>\n<li>一切的红线是不引用未来信息，定义见 <a href=\"ts-problem-framing\">时间序列问题建模</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预处理与特征工程","id":"预处理与特征工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缺失值与异常值","id":"缺失值与异常值"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化与尺度处理","id":"归一化与尺度处理"},{"level":2,"text":"滑动窗口与样本构造","id":"滑动窗口与样本构造"},{"level":2,"text":"时间特征工程","id":"时间特征工程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"经典基线 ARIMA 与 ETS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/foundations/classical-baselines"},"next":{"title":"循环网络 RNN 与 LSTM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/architectures/rnn-lstm"}}